 checked Int64 add semantics in that exact left-associated order. KEY_MISMATCH takes precedence when both checks would fail. The limit constrains the original y, not the doubled load or final result; bias is applied only in the final addition.\"}],\"mode\":\"C\",\"frozen\":true}", "metadata": {"truncated": false}, "title": "", "time": {"start": 1791598594871, "end": 1791598594885}}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "fc_043eea23ebbeb0ed016ac9a003e4588198961a3ff5db4e6497"}}, "id": "prt_123990aea001uV7JmH13tBWTnv", "sessionID": "ses_edc671d86ffeDWyqCyW4snv0ui", "messageID": "msg_12398e580001k3nlcUoY6aQKvS"}}
